# Feature layout of the Text Editor series, read by lib/recut.sh (format: see the top of that
# script). One block per patch: new files go into their feature's block; every change to an
# upstream file goes into the last block, the hooks patch.

subject: Markdown preview: Source, Preview and Split views
body: Rendered preview with inline images, HTML blocks, alerts, Mermaid diagrams, code colours, an outline, a scroll map that keeps editor and preview in step, and text that the mouse can select and copy, with tables and code blocks that scroll along with a selection, and clickable bare web addresses.
body: Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
