body: A movable Find and Replace window like Notepad++'s: whole word, extended mode, regex groups, a live count with highlights, F3 keys, matches across line breaks, In selection, a fast one-step Replace all, Find All with a Search results panel (F7), and Find in Files with Replace in Files.
